{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The|strong=\"H1732\"king rejoices in|strong=\"H1732\"your|strong=\"H1732\"strength, LORD|strong=\"H3068\"!  \nHow greatly he|strong=\"H1732\"rejoices in|strong=\"H1732\"your|strong=\"H1732\"salvation!   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"You|strong=\"H4100\"have|strong=\"H3068\"given|strong=\"H8055\"him|strong=\"H8055\"his|strong=\"H3068\"heart’s desire,  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"have|strong=\"H3068\"not withheld the|strong=\"H3068\"request of|strong=\"H4428\"his|strong=\"H3068\"lips. Selah."},{"number":3,"text":"For|strong=\"H5414\"you|strong=\"H5414\"meet him|strong=\"H5414\"with|strong=\"H3820\"the|strong=\"H5414\"blessings of|strong=\"H3820\"goodness.  \nYou|strong=\"H5414\"set|strong=\"H5414\"a|strong=\"H3068\"crown of|strong=\"H3820\"fine gold on|strong=\"H5414\"his|strong=\"H5414\"head.   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"He|strong=\"H3588\"asked life of|strong=\"H7218\"you|strong=\"H3588\"and|strong=\"H7218\"you|strong=\"H3588\"gave it|strong=\"H3588\"to|strong=\"H2896\"him|strong=\"H7896\",  \neven|strong=\"H3588\"length of|strong=\"H7218\"days forever and|strong=\"H7218\"ever.   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"His|strong=\"H5414\"glory is|strong=\"H3117\"great in|strong=\"H3117\"your|strong=\"H5414\"salvation.  \nYou|strong=\"H5414\"lay|strong=\"H5414\"honor and|strong=\"H3117\"majesty on|strong=\"H3117\"him|strong=\"H5414\".   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"For|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H5921\"make|strong=\"H7737\"him|strong=\"H5921\"most blessed forever.  \nYou|strong=\"H5921\"make|strong=\"H7737\"him|strong=\"H5921\"glad with|strong=\"H5921\"joy|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"presence|strong=\"H5921\".   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H6440\"king|strong=\"H6440\"trusts in|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\".  \nThrough|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H6440\"loving kindness of|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"Most|strong=\"H1293\"High, he|strong=\"H3588\"shall|strong=\"H6440\"not|strong=\"H3588\"be|strong=\"H6440\"moved.   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"Your|strong=\"H3068\"hand will|strong=\"H3068\"find out all|strong=\"H3068\"of|strong=\"H4428\"your|strong=\"H3068\"enemies.  \nYour|strong=\"H3068\"right|strong=\"H3068\"hand will|strong=\"H3068\"find out those|strong=\"H3588\"who|strong=\"H3068\"hate you|strong=\"H3588\".   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"You|strong=\"H3605\"will|strong=\"H3027\"make|strong=\"H3027\"them|strong=\"H3027\"as|strong=\"H3605\"a|strong=\"H3068\"fiery furnace in|strong=\"H4672\"the|strong=\"H3605\"time of|strong=\"H3027\"your|strong=\"H3605\"anger.  \nThe|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3027\"swallow them|strong=\"H3027\"up|strong=\"H3605\"in|strong=\"H4672\"his|strong=\"H3605\"wrath.  \nThe|strong=\"H3605\"fire shall|strong=\"H3027\"devour them|strong=\"H3027\".   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"You|strong=\"H6440\"will|strong=\"H3068\"destroy|strong=\"H1104\"their|strong=\"H3068\"descendants from|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"earth,  \ntheir|strong=\"H3068\"posterity from|strong=\"H6440\"among the|strong=\"H6440\"children of|strong=\"H3068\"men.   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"For|strong=\"H1121\"they intended evil against you|strong=\"H2233\".  \nThey plotted evil against you|strong=\"H2233\"which cannot succeed.   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H7451\"make|strong=\"H2803\"them|strong=\"H5921\"turn|strong=\"H5186\"their|strong=\"H5921\"back|strong=\"H5186\",  \nwhen|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"aim drawn bows at|strong=\"H5921\"their|strong=\"H5921\"face.   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"Be|strong=\"H6440\"exalted, LORD|strong=\"H3068\", in|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"strength,  \nso|strong=\"H3588\"we|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3588\"sing and|strong=\"H6440\"praise|strong=\"H3588\"your|strong=\"H5921\"power|strong=\"H3559\".   \n"}]}
